OL,3,AEx-Top Gear host Richard Hammond's
OL,4,A'brave' new Welsh life wild swimming
OL,5,Aand running
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Top Gear star Richard Hammond
OL,8,Fsays he has swapped vintage cars for
OL,9,Ffood festivals and running as he
OL,10,Fsettles into life in a Welsh market
OL,11,Ftown.
OL,13,FThe 56-year-old bought a #2m Georgian
OL,14,Fmansion in Llanwenarth, near
OL,15,FAbergavenny in Monmouthshire, in
OL,16,FNovember 2025 following his divorce
OL,17,Ffrom wife Mindy after 23 years.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
