OL,3,AEx-Top Gear host Richard Hammond's
OL,4,A'brave' new Welsh life wild swimming
OL,5,Aand running
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe presenter previously told BBC Wales
OL,8,Fhe had "never been happier" since
OL,9,Fmoving into the 19th Century home, and
OL,10,Feach week he has discovered a new
OL,11,Freason to be "delighted that I live
OL,12,Fthere".
OL,14,FWith Bannau Brycheiniog - Brecon
OL,15,FBeacons - in his back garden, Hammond
OL,16,Ftold the High Performance Podcast he
OL,17,Fhad taken up open water swimming as he
OL,18,Fbecomes "braver" than he has ever been.
